# tx_daf420.py's ingestion ledger dedups on a SHA256 of the file's exact
# bytes (core/ledger.py hash_file). Windows' core.autocrlf (on by default
# for this repo, confirmed 2026-09-13 by repeated spurious re-ingestions)
# silently rewrites LF -> CRLF for anything git treats as text, changing
# the hash without changing the content -- daf420.dat.* is fixed-width
# text, so git auto-detects it as text and normalizes it on every
# checkout/merge that touches it, making the ledger think a genuinely
# unchanged file is new every time. Mark it binary so git never touches
# its bytes.
data/tx/inbox/daf420.dat.* -text
